<title>NEW ZEALAND: Gandava offers NZ$1.60/shr for Transmark.</title>
<headline>Gandava offers NZ$1.60/shr for Transmark.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transmark Corp Ltd on Monday said that Gandava Investments Ltd intended to buy up to 15.69 million of its ordinary shares at NZ$1.60 per share.</p>
<p>The price was ex the interim dividend to be paid on September 9, 1996. Transmark last traded at NZ$1.56 a share.</p>
</text>
